## 5️⃣  Going further – common enhancements

| Feature | How to add it |
|---------|---------------|
| **Custom marker icons** | Set the `icon` property of `google.maps.Marker` to a URL or a `Symbol`. |
| **Info windows** | Use `new google.maps.InfoWindow({content: …})` and call `infoWindow.open(map, marker)`. |
| **Search / autocomplete** | Enable **Places API** → **Autocomplete** widget, then call `placesService.textSearch` or `placesService.nearbySearch`. |
| **Persist markers** | Store marker data (lat/lng, title, etc.) in a backend (e.g., Firestore) and load them on `initMap`. |
| **Cluster many markers** | Include the **MarkerClusterer** library (`@google/markerclustererplus`) to group dense markers. |
| **Styling the map** | Pass a `styles` array in the map options (JSON from Snazzy Maps or your own). |
| **Responsive UI** | Hide the default Google UI (`mapTypeControl`, `streetViewControl`, etc.) and add your own controls. |

