Below is a **complete, production‑ready design** for an “AI‑Powered Personal Travel Planner” that stitches together the OpenAI LLM with every one of the travel‑related APIs you listed.  The flow is broken into logical stages, each stage has a clear contract (JSON schema) and a set of fallback strategies, and the whole thing can be deployed as a set of server‑less micro‑services (or a classic containerised backend) with a thin front‑end UI.

