## 1. High‑Level Architecture  

```
┌─────────────────────┐
│  Front‑end (Web /   │   (React / Vue / Flutter)
│  Mobile App)        │   – collects user input
│  – preferences      │   – shows day‑by‑day plan
│  – budget, dates    │   – lets user edit / approve
│  – optional location│
└───────┬─────────────┘
        │   HTTPS (JSON)
        ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
