└───────┬─────────────┘
        │
        ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Orchestrator Service (Node / Python) – “TravelPlanner”              │
│  1️⃣  receives the raw request                                         │
│  2️⃣  calls **OpenAI** (function‑calling mode) to:                     │
│      • extract a structured “TravelRequest” JSON (preferences,      │
