│        – Flights / Trains / Car rentals                               │
│        – Hotels / Airbnbs                                             │
│        – Activities / Meals                                          │
│  5️⃣  feeds the enriched request back to **OpenAI** (system‑prompt)   │
│      to generate a **Day‑by‑Day Itinerary** (JSON + natural‑language   │
│      description)                                                     │
│  6️⃣  optional post‑processing:                                        │
│      • PDF generation (e.g. PDFShift, CloudConvert)                  │
│      • Calendar export (iCal / Google Calendar)                     │
│      • Email / SMS / Push delivery (SendGrid, Twilio, Firebase)      │
│  7️⃣  stores the final itinerary in a DB (PostgreSQL / DynamoDB)      │
